Package: idiolect
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Idiolect maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: fcitx5, systemd, libc6
Description: Local-first speech-to-text input method for Linux
 Idiolect installs a local dictation daemon, command-line tools, and an
 Fcitx5 input-method engine for privacy-preserving speech-to-text.
